 <h3><u>Abbas jo zinda hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Abbas...<br> Baawafaa Ya Abbas....<br> Abbas, abbas, abbas, abbas..(2)</p> 
  <p>Mehfooz qaafela Hai Abbas Jo zindaa Hai<br> Abhi door karbala Hai..(3), Abbas Jo zindaa Hai</p> 
  <p>1) Is noori ka Karwaa mey noori amaariyaa hai<br> Noori amaariyo mey (noori sawaariyaa Hai)..(2)<br> Sarr par Alam khulaa Hai, Abbas Jo zindaa Hai</p> 
  <p>2) Naa mehramo ka majmaa hat-hat key Hai guzarta<br> Pehrey mey baawafaa ke (Taiy horaha Hai rastaa)..(2)<br> Kya shaan o dabdabaa Hai, Abbas Jo zindaa Hai</p> 
  <p>3) Abbas jaisa Bhai saalaar kaarwaa Hai<br> Boley Husain mujhko (phir koi ghum kahaa Hai)..(2)<br> Har ghum ki ye dawaa Hai, Abbas Jo zindaa Hai</p> 
  <p>4) Zainab hayaa ki malka kulsoom aur ruqayya<br> Laila, rabaab, farwaa, (kubraa, Sakina, fizza)..(2)<br> Har Bibi baaridaa Hai, Abbas Jo zindaa Hai</p> 
  <p>5) Asghar se khelti Hai khush Hai bohat sakina<br> Jab chaahti Hai Sona (Hai baba jaa ka seena)..(2)<br> Ghum se na aashna Hai, Abbas Jo zindaa hai</p> 
